<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<includes>
	<!-- From Kodi 22 Estuary's Includes_Games.xml (GPL-2.0-or-later, see LICENSE-Estuary.txt), restyled for Bald
	     (docs/NOTES.md, "Media windows restyle"). The four game dialogs DialogGameControllers.xml draws: controller
	     setup, ports, players (agents) and the disc manager. Every id is Kodi's (games/controllers/windows/
	     GUIControllerDefines.h, games/ports/windows/GUIPortDefines.h, games/agents/windows/GUIAgentDefines.h,
	     games/dialogs/disc/DiscManagerIDs.h). Estuary's commented-out static test content and radio-button example
	     were left out. Surfaces are the shared Bald popup; rows use the popup list's 10% ink focus row, controller
	     artwork is tinted with the accent, and Estuary's inner panel frames are gone. -->
